      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_9d4abfc05ac279eed6878abaa8ff66bdd0ef785f5f0ffffc9c99987aaa984486"
      ],
      "text": "Nodes run their agents without permission prompts by default: seeded configs disable approval gates (e.g. Claude bypassPermissions, Codex danger-full-access), and the per-node worktree isolates only the branch, not the filesystem or network."
    },
